sequenceDiagram
    participant EB as EventBridge (weekly cron)
    participant E as edgar_client.py
    participant S3R as S3 (finrag-raw-filings)
    participant H as html_processor.py
    participant S3P as S3 (finrag-processed-filings)
    participant C as chunker.py
    participant Sy as sync_pinecone.py
    participant T as Bedrock Titan Embeddings V2
    participant PC as Pinecone (finrag-filings index)

    EB->>E: trigger ingestion
    E->>E: GET sec.gov/files/company_tickers.json (ticker -> CIK)
    E->>E: GET data.sec.gov/submissions/CIK{cik}.json (list filings)
    E->>E: GET sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/... (download HTML)
    E->>S3R: store {ticker}/{filing_type}/{date}.htm
    H->>S3R: read filing HTML
    H->>H: BeautifulSoup text block extraction
    H->>H: pandas.read_html table extraction
    H->>S3P: store {text_blocks, tables, metadata}.json
    C->>S3P: read processed JSON
    C->>C: hierarchical chunk (parent 1500w / child 400w / table)
    Sy->>C: read chunks
    Sy->>T: embed chunk text (InvokeModel)
    T-->>Sy: embedding vector (1024-dim)
    Sy->>PC: upsert(id, vector, metadata)
    Note over PC: corpus ready for queries
